け)\n\n▼構図等詳細\nご負担のないようにおまかせで描いて頂ければと思います。幾つか服の資料も添付させて頂きましたが、アレンジ等自由にしてください。\n\n▼使用用途\n個人観賞、個人的なグッズの作成、SNSのヘッダー(使用させて頂く際はお名前を記載させて頂きます)\n\n金額や条件など合いませんでしたら再送請求・キャンセルしていただき問題ございません。お手すきの際ご検討いただければ幸いです！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1i7jZDPsR0JPQWprYYpubgGdL6MDAH4aZ?usp=drive_link", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 19256, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "あびり", "screen_name": "abilirn", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1843270398663917569/GxdgA-zq.png", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/2701215690/1771788134/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 49}, {"id": 1890182, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "マカチャン", "screen_name": "makachandayo", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1890844339829698560/McFCsDtD.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1455094428394090502/1763638509/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 129}, {"id": 2429315, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "u_da", "screen_name": "xAx_057", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1694295493210415104/39bmI5zP.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1550997898661228545/1746639570/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_accepta